{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Aaron shall cast lots upon the two goats.</b> He stands one at the right and one at the left, and places both his hands in the קַלְפִּי, and takes a lot in his right hand and its fellow in his left and places them upon them — the one on which 'לַשֵּׁם' is written is for the Name, and the one on which 'לַעֲזָאזֵל' is written is sent to Azazel (Yoma 39)." "<b>Azazel.</b> It is a mountain strong and hard, a high cliff — as it says אֶרֶץ גְּזֵרָה — cut off."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:42.338398173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}